From: Leonardo Arena <rnalrd@alpinelinux.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 10:16:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] go.mod: bump libovsdb to v0.9.1

v0.9.0 fails to build on 32-bit architectures (math.MinInt64 and
math.MaxInt64 overflow int). Fixed in v0.9.1.

Backport of the relevant part of https://github.com/lxc/incus/pull/4330
See https://github.com/lxc/incus/issues/4300
---
 go.mod | 2 +-
 go.sum | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
index 77f5717..4758edf 100644
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -53,7 +53,7 @@ require (
 	github.com/opencontainers/umoci v0.6.1-0.20251213054154-70fc5ee1f4df
 	github.com/openfga/go-sdk v0.8.3
 	github.com/osrg/gobgp/v4 v4.10.0
-	github.com/ovn-kubernetes/libovsdb v0.9.0
+	github.com/ovn-kubernetes/libovsdb v0.9.1
 	github.com/pierrec/lz4/v4 v4.1.33
 	github.com/pires/go-proxyproto v0.16.0
 	github.com/pkg/sftp v1.13.12
